    "text": "NebraskaTV\nwebsite\nNebraska\nCattle prices surge to record highs at NE sale barns\nBy Jack Bartlett, Ariana Joy Cobler,\n3 hours agoKEARNEY, Neb. — Two livestock markets in central Nebraska saw record-breaking feeder cattle prices last week. This a sign of long-awaited relief for ranchers and sale barn operators who’ve endured years of tight margins. Rick Shoemaker, owner of Huss and Lexington Livestock Markets, said business is thriving as...\n12",
